---
import PortalLayout from '../../layouts/PortalLayout.astro';
---

<PortalLayout title="Verify a DIFL Certificate" description="Verify a certificate issued by Dante Institute of Foreign Languages." robots="index, follow">
  <div class="portal-shell verify-page">
    <header class="portal-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="DIFL home"><img src="/assets/difl-logo.png" alt="" /><div><strong>DIFL</strong><span>Dante Institute of Foreign Languages · Since 1971</span></div></a>
      <a class="home-link" href="/">Visit mydifl.com</a>
    </header>
    <main class="verify-wrap">
      <section class="verify-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Official certificate registry</p>
        <h1>Verify a DIFL certificate</h1>
        <p>Use the private verification link supplied by the certificate holder or DIFL. Student names are partially masked to protect personal information.</p>
        <p lang="hi"><strong>हिंदी:</strong> DIFL या विद्यार्थी द्वारा दिया गया verification link खोलें। यदि केवल code मिला है, तो नीचे पूरा 48-character code डालकर <strong>Verify certificate</strong> दबाएँ। सही certificate मिलने पर उसका number, course, language, issue date और status दिखाई देगा। Privacy के लिए विद्यार्थी का नाम 20% छिपाया जाता है।</p>
      </section>
      <section class="card card-pad verify-card">
        <form id="verify-form">
          <div class="field"><label for="verification-code">Verification code · सत्यापन कोड</label><input id="verification-code" name="code" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="48" pattern="[A-Fa-f0-9]{48}" required /></div>
          <button id="verify-button" class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Verify certificate · सत्यापित करें</button>
        </form>
        <div id="verify-message" class="notice hidden" role="status"></div>
        <div id="result" class="result hidden" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="result-head"><div id="result-mark" class="result-mark">✓</div><div><p id="result-label" class="result-label">Verified</p><h2 id="result-number"></h2></div></div>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Student</dt><dd id="result-name"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Course</dt><dd id="result-course"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Language & level</dt><dd id="result-language"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Date of issue</dt><dd id="result-date"></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Certificate status</dt><dd id="result-status"></dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="privacy-note">For privacy, the student’s name is 20% masked. Phone number, email, address, and certificate scan are never disclosed here.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <p class="support">Need assistance? Contact DIFL through the details published on <a href="/">mydifl.com</a>. Never send confidential student data to an unverified contact.</p>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="../../scripts/verify.ts"></script>
</PortalLayout>

<style>
  .verify-page { background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, #e6edf9, transparent 34%), var(--wash); }
  .home-link { color: white; font-weight: 700; font-size: .9rem; }
  .verify-wrap { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0 4rem; }
  .verify-intro { text-align: center; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }
  .verify-intro p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }
  #verify-form { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: .7rem; align-items: end; }
  .result { margin-top: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #a9d7bd; background: #f2fbf6; border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.25rem; }
  .result.invalid { border-color: #efb5af; background: #fff4f2; }
  .result-head { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23,114,69,.2); }
  .result-mark { width: 48px; height: 48px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); color: white; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .invalid .result-mark { background: var(--red); }
  .result-label { margin: 0 0 .2rem; color: var(--green); font-weight: 800; }
  .invalid .result-label { color: var(--red); }
  .result h2 { margin: 0; }
  dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin: 1.25rem 0; }
  dl div { padding: .8rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.7); border-radius: 9px; }
  dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  dd { margin: .25rem 0 0; font-weight: 750; }
  .privacy-note, .support { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; font-size: .86rem; }
  .support { text-align: center; margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { #verify-form, dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .home-link { display: none; } }
</style>
